<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Toyota, Honda cut by M. Stanley.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Toyota, Honda cut by M. Stanley.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it reduced the rating on Toyota Motor Corp and Honda Motor Co Ltd to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Honda ADRS closed at 66-1/4 and Toyota ended at 62-1/2 on Friday.</p>
</text>
